Case: Valid sign in
Goal: Sign in with valid credentials
Input: Email = @valid.email
Input: Password = @valid.password
Expect: text "Welcome back" is visible
Expect: url is "/projects"

Case: Invalid password
Goal: Sign in with an invalid password
Input: Email = @valid.email
Input: Password = @invalid.password
Expect: text "Invalid credentials" is visible
Expect: text "Welcome back" is absent

Case: Create and persist
Auth: @signed-in
Goal: Create project named "Acme"
Expect: project named "Acme" exists exactly once after reload

Case: Rename
Auth: @signed-in
Goal: Rename project "Demo" to "Acme"
Expect: project named "Acme" exists exactly once after reload
Expect: project named "Demo" exists exactly zero times

Case: Archive
Auth: @signed-in
Goal: Archive project "Demo"
Expect: text "Archived" in record "Demo" is visible

Case: Filter
Auth: @signed-in
Goal: Filter projects to Archived
Expect: project named "Demo" exists exactly zero times
Expect: project named "Legacy" exists exactly once

Case: Persist select
Auth: @signed-in
Goal: Set "Theme" to "Dark"
Expect: field "Theme" is "Dark" after reload

Case: Persist checkbox
Auth: @signed-in
Goal: Check "Enable notifications"
Expect: checkbox "Enable notifications" is checked after reload

Case: Required field
Auth: @signed-in
Goal: Create a project with an empty name
Input: Project name = ""
Expect: text "Project name is required" is visible
Expect: project named "Untitled" exists exactly zero times

Case: Asynchronous search
Auth: @signed-in
Goal: Search projects for "Demo"
Expect: project named "Demo" exists exactly once
Expect: project named "Legacy" exists exactly zero times
